✅ 2. Build & Practice Truth Tables
Start from simple to complex:

¬P (Negation)

P ∧ Q (Conjunction)

P ∨ Q (Disjunction)

(P → Q), (P ↔ Q), (P ⊕ Q) — Conditionals and beyond

Then: ((P → Q) ∧ (¬R ∨ Q))

